tic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used, never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"region_baytown/agc_2025_48_201_0807_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0807","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88379,"sha256":"e7c04aa45bf53b4ee12208ee37a85734f47eb2053e030e92ee6f4349644e369c","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:25:33+00:00"},{"file":"region_baytown/agc_2025_48_201_0617_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0617","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88199,"sha256":"ebf20f71e6948ecd29bff06cf982b14819f2c5d99cda4180c8b9125e7b86baaf","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:25:58+00:00"},{"file":"region_baytown/tamis_48_201_0807.html","url":"https://www17.tceq.texas.gov/tamis/index.cfm?fuseaction=report.view_site&siteAQS=482010807","params":null,"bytes":90626,"sha256":"b0c18bd60bff2b4d9c724f06a2fc24da6514c486cc45b140aa7437f59dc128b4","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:25:04+00:00"},{"file":"region_baytown/tamis_48_201_0617.html","url":"https://www17.tceq.texas.gov/tamis/index.cfm?fuseaction=report.view_site&siteAQS=482010617","params":null,"bytes":